available in diameters ranging from 500mm to 3000mm, allowing customization to fit various architectural and display needs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the Round LED Display P2.5 and is it suitable for indoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 1,200 nits, this display is optimized primarily for indoor environments such as lobbies and museums, offering vibrant visuals without excessive glare.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty does Brightluxx offer for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a standard warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance issues, typically lasting 2-3 years. Specific terms are available upon purchase inquiry.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this circular LED display compare to traditional rectangular LED panels?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This product offers a unique circular design that enhances aesthetic appeal and fits architectural elements seamlessly, whereas traditional rectangular panels are limited to flat surfaces and conventional layouts.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the Round LED Display P2.5 be installed on ceilings and curved surfaces?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is designed specifically for circular applications including ceilings and curved architectural features, ensuring easy integration with custom supports or fittings.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What industries benefit most from this custom-shaped LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It is ideal for premium retail environments, corporate lobbies, museums, and architectural centers looking to create engaging visual statements with high resolution and form-fitting designs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is pricing determined for this custom 