, \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>Round LED Display P2.5</h1><p>Discover the Round LED Display P2.5 in Dubai. Ideal for stunning 360° visuals. Get yours from Brightluxx, UAE's LED solution expert!</p><p><strong>Circular LED module. Perfect for lobbies, retail, and architectural features.</strong></p><p>The Round LED Display P2.5 features a precise 2.5mm pixel pitch in a customizable circular form factor, making it perfect for enhancing indoor spaces such as lobbies, retail windows, museums, and architectural installations. With 1,200 nits brightness and diameters from 500 to 3000mm, this premium LED module blends cutting-edge technology with aesthetic flexibility.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the Round LED Display P2.5?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, providing high-resolution visuals ideal for close viewing distances common in indoor environments like lobbies and retail spaces.</p><h3>What sizes are available for this circular LED module?</h3><p>The Round LED Display P2.5 is available in diameters ranging from 500mm to 3000mm, allowing customization to fit various architectural and display needs.</p><h3>How bright is the Round LED Display P2.5 and is it suitable for indoor use?</h3><p>With a brightness of 1,200 nits, this display is optimized primarily for indoor environments such as lobbies and museums, offering vibrant visuals without excessive glare.</p><h3>What warranty does Brightluxx offer for this product?</h3><p>Brightluxx provides a standard warranty covering ma