e\"}]}10:Ta74,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the Round LED Display P2.5?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The pixel pitch is 2.5mm, providing high-resolution visuals ideal for close viewing distances common in indoor environments like lobbies and retail spaces.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What sizes are available for this circular LED module?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The Round LED Display P2.5 is available in diameters ranging from 500mm to 3000mm, allowing customization to fit various architectural and display needs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the Round LED Display P2.5 and is it suitable for indoor use?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness of 1,200 nits, this display is optimized primarily for indoor environments such as lobbies and museums, offering vibrant visuals without excessive glare.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty does Brightluxx offer for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a standard warranty covering manufacturing defects and performance issues, typically lasting 2-3 years. Specific terms are available upon purchase inquiry.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this circular LED display compare to traditional rectangular LED panels?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"This product offers a unique circular design that enhances aesthetic appeal and fits architectural elements seamlessly, whereas traditional rectangular panels are limited to flat surfaces and conventional layouts.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the Round LED Display P2.5 be installed on ceilings and curved surfaces?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is designed specifically for circular applications including ceilings and curved architectural features, ensuring easy integration with custom supports or fittings.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What industries benefit most from this custom-shaped LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It is ideal for premium retail environments, corporate lobbies, museums, and architectural centers looking to create engaging visual statements with high resolution and form-fitting designs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is pricing determined for this custom circular LED display?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Pricing depends on the chosen diameter, customization level, and installation complexity. Contact Brightluxx for a detailed quote tailored to your project requirements.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Round LED Display P2.5\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/round-led-display-p25\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https: